  "description": "I possessed the body of the “gwang-gong” inside a BL game my junior made. The name was the same, but there was absolutely nothing in common between Gwak Seon-woo the deranged villain and Gwak Seon-woo the ordinary citizen.\n\nA house entirely black with no signs of human life. A fridge stocked only with energy drinks and liquor.\n\n“Ack—cold!”  \n< You have uttered something unsuitable for a gwang-gong. Gwang-gong score –9. >\n\nShowers can only be taken using a sunflower-shaped showerhead, and the water temperature cannot be adjusted. He desperately craves hot chocolate, but the only coffee options allowed are espresso and americano.\nForget his comfort food—he can’t even choose a basic franchise sandwich. He must somehow protect his constantly cancelled mealtimes.\n\n“Can’t I just… have one proper meal…?”\n\n< Gwang-gong do not obsess over food. Gwang-gong score –2. >  \n< Current gwang-gong score: 49 >  \n< Status ailment triggered: Insomnia (score below 50)! Raise gwang-gong score to resolve. >\n\nIn this harsh world, the only person who can help a gwang-gong live something close to a human life is the main su! …Or so the system claims, but Seon-woo absolutely refuses to create any weird atmosphere. Unexplainable affection toward the main su, and uncontrollable rage the moment he sees the sub-gong.\nBrushing off the emotions the system keeps pushing onto him, Seon-woo scrambles to pick from the choices.\n\n‣ “Shut up!”  \n‣ “Get lost!”  \n‣ “Nonsense!”\n\n…If only he could actually choose them.\n\n*Note: Gwang-gong = Obsessive gong or yandere seme  \nMain su = Main character su, MC uke\nSub-gong = Second gong, the second male lead*\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2093062734)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3846000198)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/136153), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1110440), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00209)  \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/136152)",
